        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": false,
        "si_used": true,
        "procedure": "Under purified nitrogen, nBuLi (13.2 mL, 1.99 N, 26.26 mmol) was added dropwise at room temperature to 1, [p-tBu-calix[4]-(OMe)2(OH)2]·(C7H8)1.5 (10.7 g, 13.13 mmol), in THF (220 mL). SmCl3(THF)2 (5.25 g, 13.1 mmol) was added and the mixture was stirred overnight at room temperature. Volatiles were removed and benzene (150 mL) was added; the suspension was stirred for 1 h. The solid was collected, extracted with its mother liquor, the suspension was concentrated to about 60 mL, and the solid was dried in vacuo. Crystals for X-ray analysis were obtained from THF. The crystallographic formula is C100H132Cl2O10Sm2·4THF; elemental analysis was reported for unsolvated C100H132Cl2O10Sm2.",
